IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`
IMPORT fixtures

§ `Terms and Conditions — DBS yuu Card Programme and Promotions`

-- ===========================================================================
-- DOCUMENT. dbs-yuu-card-tnc: "Terms and Conditions: DBS yuu Card Programme and
-- Promotions", "Updated on 7 August 2026" on every page, cl.1-22 and Appendix 1
-- (DBS Bank Ltd). It governs the DBS yuu Visa and the DBS yuu American Express.
-- The yuu Rewards Club terms (yuu.sg) and the yuu app, where the merchant list's
-- "full list of exclusions" lives, are not held.
--
-- WHAT THE TEXT SAYS.
--   cl.6     Base Rewards for every S$1 "charged and posted": yuu Merchant Spend
--            1 yuu Point (0.5% cash rebates); SimplyGo 0.5 yuu Point; Non-yuu
--            Merchant Spend 0.5 yuu Point. No minimum, no cap.
--   cl.7     Bonus Rewards, "capped at 28,800 yuu Points ... per calendar month".
--            (a) no minimum spend: yuu Merchant Spend 9 yuu Points; SimplyGo 9.5.
--            (b) "Minimum S$800 worth of Eligible Spend charged and posted to your
--            Card, and Transact at 4 Participating Merchants" each calendar month:
--            yuu Merchant Spend 26 yuu Points (13%); SimplyGo 26.
--   cl.8     "Participating Merchants": Cold Storage (Cold Storage, CS Fresh,
--            Jasons Deli), Giant (Giant, Giant Hypermart, Giant Express), Guardian,
--            7-Eleven, foodpanda (food delivery, panda mart, panda shops), Gojek
--            Singapore, SimplyGo (bus and train rides), Charge+ Singapore, CHAGEE
--            (orders via the CHAGEE App), Singtel (Singtel Shop, Singtel
--            Exclusive Retailers) -- "transactions made in Singapore at" them.
--   cl.9     "Eligible Spend" excludes refunds, pre-authorisations, balance
--            transfers, cash advances, MP3, fees; 0% IPP; other bill payments via
--            internet banking and fees charged by DBS; 44 MCCs (a Table whose
--            asterisked rows are "With effect from 1 May 2026"); nineteen
--            description families; other transactions DBS determines.
--   cl.10    Eligible Spend "must be charged to your DBS yuu Card within the
--            calendar month, based on transaction date."
--   cl.12    "1 yuu Point is equivalent to 0.5% cash rebate or 0.28 miles or more,
--            depending on the redemption item".
--   cl.13    Only posted transactions count.
--   cl.18    Supplementary-card spend counts toward the principal's Eligible Spend.
--   cl.22    Foreign-currency spend counts at the posted Singapore-dollar amount.
--   App.1    Per merchant: what earns no Base Rewards, no Bonus Rewards, or neither;
--            and, at the foot, "DBS will not award Bonus Rewards on transactions
--            that do not earn Base Rewards from yuu/Participating Merchants,
--            unless otherwise stated."
--
-- THE FORKS.
--   F-yuu-stack: do cl.7(a) and cl.7(b) ADD, or does (b) REPLACE (a) once the
--     minimum is met? The text calls (b) "the following Bonus Rewards" and says
--     nothing of (a) being displaced. Additive: 9 + 26 = 35 Bonus + 1 Base = 36 per
--     S$1 (10.08 miles per S$1 at 0.28), the cap reached at S$822.86 of spend.
--     Replacement: 26 + 1 = 27 per S$1 (7.56 miles), the cap at S$1,107.69.
--     The module takes the lower total as the floor and the higher as the ceiling
--     and names the open reading.
--   F-singtel-base: Appendix 1 says, under "Applicable to Base Rewards" for
--     SingtelShop! and Singtel Exclusive Retailers: "Points will not be awarded for
--     all transactions." Read alone, no Singtel transaction earns Base Rewards, and
--     by the closing sentence none earns Bonus Rewards; then the next block
--     ("Applicable to Base and Bonus Rewards ... Corporate plans/sign up, Prepaid
--     card top-up, Recurring bill payment and bill payments") is redundant. The
--     module gives a Singtel purchase a floor of 0 and a ceiling of the ordinary
--     earn, and names the open reading.
--   F-yuu-services: "All services (bonus points only, base points exclusion)":
--     the parenthesis can be read as "bonus points are not awarded; the base
--     exclusion is the point" or the reverse. The module excludes a service from
--     both (the closing sentence) and gives no ceiling above that.
--   F-bill-payments: a Singtel bill paid directly on the card is "bill payments".
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `cl.9 -- Eligible Spend`

-- The 44 MCCs of cl.9(f). Rows marked "*" are "With effect from 1 May 2026".
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`the yuu excluded category codes` MEANS
    LIST 4784, 4829, 4900, 5047, 5199, 5960, 5993, 6010, 6011, 6012, 6050, 6051,
         6211, 6300, 6381, 6399, 6513, 6529, 6530, 6534, 6540, 7349, 7511, 7523,
         7995, 8062, 8211, 8220, 8241, 8244, 8249, 8299, 8398, 8651, 8661, 8699,
         8999, 9211, 9222, 9223, 9311, 9399, 9402, 9405

GIVEN k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`yuu cl.9 excludes the kind` k MEANS
    CONSIDER k
    WHEN `Retail purchase`                                   THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Bill payment`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`      THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Top-up of a prepaid card or stored-value account`  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Payment of funds to a payment service provider`    THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Instalment plan charge`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `My Preferred Payment Plan charge`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cash advance`                                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Balance transfer or funds transfer`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Fee, interest or finance charge`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Pre-authorisation`                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Payment through UOB Payment Facility`              THEN FALSE
    WHEN `NETS or NETS-related transaction`                  THEN FALSE
    WHEN `SmartPay or personal loan`                         THEN FALSE
    WHEN `Transit-related transaction`                       THEN FALSE

-- cl.9(f)(i): the description families: AMAZE, AXS, AXS BizPay, BAGUS, CANTINE,
-- EZ-LINK, EZLINK, PAYPAL AXS PTE LTD, RAZERPAY, SAM PAYMENTS, SEDAP, Sgebiz,
-- SGeBiz, Singapore E-Business, SINGTEL DASH, SHOPEEPAY, SmoovPay (1 May 2026),
-- TRANSIT 3, YOUTRIP.
GIVEN d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`yuu cl.9(f)(i) names the description` d MEANS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `Amaze`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `AXS`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Bagus`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Cantine`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `EZ-Link`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `PayPal AXS Pte Ltd`     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Razerpay`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SAM`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sedap`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sgebiz`                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singapore E-Business`   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singtel Dash`           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `ShopeePay`              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SmoovPay`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `TRANSIT`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Youtrip`                THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                          FALSE

-- cl.9, cl.13: Eligible Spend is posted spend that none of the above removes.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is Eligible Spend` p MEANS
    NOT (`yuu cl.9 excludes the kind` (p's `charge kind`))
    AND NOT (`the code is among` p `the yuu excluded category codes`)
    AND NOT (`yuu cl.9(f)(i) names the description` (p's descriptor))
    AND NOT (p's `later reversed`)


§§ `cl.8 -- Participating Merchants, and the brands that count as one`

GIVEN who IS A Merchant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the merchant is a yuu Participating Merchant` who MEANS
    CONSIDER who
    WHEN `Cold Storage`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `CS Fresh`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Jasons Deli`                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Giant`                      THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Guardian`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `7-Eleven`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `foodpanda`                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Gojek Singapore`            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SimplyGo`                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Charge+`                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `CHAGEE`                     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `SingtelShop!`               THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Singtel Exclusive Retailer` THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                              FALSE

-- cl.8's first column is the brand: Cold Storage, CS Fresh and Jasons Deli are one
-- Participating Merchant, and so are SingtelShop! and Singtel Exclusive Retailers.
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
GIVETH A Merchant
`the yuu brand of` who MEANS
    CONSIDER who
    WHEN `CS Fresh`                   THEN `Cold Storage`
    WHEN `Jasons Deli`                THEN `Cold Storage`
    WHEN `Singtel Exclusive Retailer` THEN `SingtelShop!`
    OTHERWISE                              who

GIVEN hits IS A LIST OF Merchant
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of Participating Merchants among` hits MEANS
    count (nub (map `the yuu brand of` (filter `the merchant is a yuu Participating Merchant` hits)))


§§ `Appendix 1 -- what earns nothing at a Participating Merchant`

-- Base-rewards carve-outs shared by Cold Storage and Giant (and by Guardian and
-- 7-Eleven, with their own additions): plastic bags, tobacco, delivery charges,
-- services, cash-like items, statutory items, vouchers and magazines, gift cards
-- bought, infant milk formula, sushi and sashimi.
GIVEN thing IS AN Item
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing MEANS
    CONSIDER thing
    WHEN `A plastic bag`                                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Tobacco or cigarettes`                                     THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A delivery charge`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A service such as a mobile or EZ-Link reload`              THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A cash-like item such as a SIM top-up voucher`             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A statutory service or product`                            THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A DFI voucher or magazine`                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A gift card or voucher being bought`                       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Listed infant milk formula`                                THEN TRUE
    WHEN `Sushi or sashimi`                                          THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A lottery product, bill payment, top-up service or Qoo10 payment` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A foodpanda dine-in order`                                 THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A pandago order`                                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `An order on a corporate account`                           THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A pandapay wallet top-up`                                  THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A pandapro subscription`                                   THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A discount, voucher, delivery fee, platform fee or rider tip` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A Singtel corporate plan or sign-up`                       THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A Singtel prepaid card top-up`                             THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A Singtel bill payment`                                    THEN TRUE
    WHEN `A SimplyGo top-up`                                         THEN TRUE
    WHEN `An order placed outside the merchant's own app`            THEN TRUE
    OTHERWISE                                                             FALSE

-- Item carve-outs apply only at the merchants whose row lists them; the list
-- above is the union, so each row's items are read per merchant here.
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      thing IS AN Item
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 gives the merchant no Base Rewards on the item` who thing MEANS
    CONSIDER who
    WHEN `Cold Storage`               THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `CS Fresh`                   THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `Jasons Deli`                THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `Giant`                      THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `Guardian`                   THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `7-Eleven`                   THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `foodpanda`                  THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `Singtel Exclusive Retailer` THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `SingtelShop!`               THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `SimplyGo`                   THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    WHEN `CHAGEE`                     THEN `Appendix 1 lists the item as earning no Base Rewards` thing
    OTHERWISE                              FALSE

-- Outlet carve-outs: "Purchases at all stores at Changi Airport" (Guardian,
-- 7-Eleven; Base); vending machines at 7-Eleven (Base and Bonus, from 1 December
-- 2025); Cold Storage On The Go within Esso stations (Bonus Rewards only: Base
-- 0.5 earned, and it counts toward the minimum spend).
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      out IS AN Outlet
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 gives the merchant no Base Rewards at the outlet` who out MEANS
    (out EQUALS `A Changi Airport store` AND (who EQUALS `Guardian` OR who EQUALS `7-Eleven`))
    OR (out EQUALS `A vending machine` AND who EQUALS `7-Eleven`)

-- "Description 'PayPal'": foodpanda and Gojek, from 1 February 2024.
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      d IS A Descriptor
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 gives the merchant no points for the description` who d MEANS
    (who EQUALS `foodpanda` OR who EQUALS `Gojek Singapore`) AND d EQUALS `PayPal`

-- Singtel: "Recurring bill payment and bill payments" -- by item or by kind.
GIVEN who IS A Merchant
      thing IS AN Item
      k IS A `Charge kind`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is a Singtel bill` who thing k MEANS
    (who EQUALS `SingtelShop!` OR who EQUALS `Singtel Exclusive Retailer`)
    AND (thing EQUALS `A Singtel bill payment`
         OR k EQUALS `Bill payment`
         OR k EQUALS `Bill paid directly to the biller on the card`)

-- All the Base-reward carve-outs together, for one purchase.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 removes the purchase from yuu Merchant Spend` p MEANS
    `Appendix 1 gives the merchant no Base Rewards on the item` (p's merchant) (p's item)
    OR `Appendix 1 gives the merchant no Base Rewards at the outlet` (p's merchant) (p's outlet)
    OR `Appendix 1 gives the merchant no points for the description` (p's merchant) (p's descriptor)
    OR `the purchase is a Singtel bill` (p's merchant) (p's item) (p's `charge kind`)

-- Bonus carve-outs for the card: "Points will not be awarded for any
-- transactions made with DBS yuu American Express Card" at Charge+ (Bonus), and
-- at 7-Eleven (Bonus) until 13 August 2026, when "American Express Cards will be
-- accepted at all 7-Eleven outlets" and the yuu Amex "can earn bonus rewards".
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 withholds Bonus Rewards from the card on the purchase` c p MEANS
    c EQUALS `DBS yuu American Express`
    AND ((p's merchant EQUALS `Charge+`)
         OR (p's merchant EQUALS `7-Eleven` AND p's `date charged` LESS THAN Date 13 8 2026))

-- Cold Storage On The Go within Esso: Bonus withheld, Base 0.5.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is Cold Storage On The Go within an Esso station` p MEANS
    p's outlet EQUALS `Cold Storage On The Go within an Esso station`

-- The Singtel base sentence, read alone (fork F-singtel-base).
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is at Singtel Shop or an Exclusive Retailer` p MEANS
    p's merchant EQUALS `SingtelShop!` OR p's merchant EQUALS `Singtel Exclusive Retailer`


§§ `cl.6, cl.7 -- the rates, in yuu Points per S$1`

GIVETH A NUMBER
`yuu Base Points per S$1 of yuu Merchant Spend` MEANS 1

GIVETH A NUMBER
`yuu Base Points per S$1 of SimplyGo or Non-yuu Merchant Spend` MEANS 0.5

GIVETH A NUMBER
`yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(a)` MEANS 9

GIVETH A NUMBER
`yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(a) at SimplyGo` MEANS 9.5

GIVETH A NUMBER
`yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(b)` MEANS 26

GIVETH A NUMBER
`yuu Bonus Points cap per calendar month` MEANS 28800

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the S$ minimum Eligible Spend under cl.7(b)` MEANS 800

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the number of Participating Merchants required under cl.7(b)` MEANS 4

-- cl.12: 1 yuu Point = S$0.005 or 0.28 miles "or more".
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the S$ value of one yuu Point` MEANS 0.005

GIVETH A NUMBER
`the miles at least per yuu Point` MEANS 0.28

-- cl.8: "transactions made in Singapore at" a Participating Merchant, and not
-- carved out by Appendix 1: this is yuu Merchant Spend.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase is yuu Merchant Spend` p MEANS
    `the merchant is a yuu Participating Merchant` (p's merchant)
    AND p's `store location` EQUALS `A store in Singapore`
    AND NOT (`Appendix 1 removes the purchase from yuu Merchant Spend` p)

-- A purchase at a Participating Merchant that Appendix 1 removes earns nothing:
-- no Base Rewards, and by the closing sentence no Bonus Rewards.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Appendix 1 removes a Participating Merchant purchase` p MEANS
    `the merchant is a yuu Participating Merchant` (p's merchant)
    AND p's `store location` EQUALS `A store in Singapore`
    AND `Appendix 1 removes the purchase from yuu Merchant Spend` p

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu Base Points per S$1 on` p MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `Appendix 1 removes a Participating Merchant purchase` p
            THEN 0
        IF `the purchase is yuu Merchant Spend` p AND (NOT (p's merchant EQUALS `SimplyGo`)) AND (NOT (`the purchase is Cold Storage On The Go within an Esso station` p))
            THEN `yuu Base Points per S$1 of yuu Merchant Spend`
        OTHERWISE `yuu Base Points per S$1 of SimplyGo or Non-yuu Merchant Spend`

-- The Bonus rate under cl.7(a) alone, per S$1.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu cl.7(a) Bonus Points per S$1 on` p MEANS
    IF p's merchant EQUALS `SimplyGo`
    THEN `yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(a) at SimplyGo`
    ELSE `yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(a)`

-- Whether the purchase is yuu Merchant Spend that can earn Bonus Rewards.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the purchase can earn yuu Bonus Rewards on` c p MEANS
    `the purchase is yuu Merchant Spend` p
    AND NOT (`Appendix 1 withholds Bonus Rewards from the card on the purchase` c p)
    AND NOT (`the purchase is Cold Storage On The Go within an Esso station` p)


§§ `The Minimum Spend Requirement (cl.7(b)): S$800 and four Participating Merchants`

-- Does the month, with this purchase added, meet it? The purchase counts toward
-- the spend if it is Eligible Spend, and toward the merchants if it is at a
-- Participating Merchant whose Appendix row does not remove it.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the Eligible Spend with this purchase` p m MEANS
    (m's `Eligible Spend posted`) PLUS (IF `the purchase is Eligible Spend` p THEN p's `amount in SGD` ELSE 0)

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A LIST OF Merchant
`the Participating Merchants with this purchase` p m MEANS
    IF `the purchase is yuu Merchant Spend` p
    THEN append (m's `merchants hit`) (LIST (p's merchant))
    ELSE m's `merchants hit`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the Minimum Spend Requirement is met with` p `in the month` m MEANS
    (`the Eligible Spend with this purchase` p m) AT LEAST `the S$ minimum Eligible Spend under cl.7(b)`
    AND (`the number of Participating Merchants among` (`the Participating Merchants with this purchase` p m)) AT LEAST `the number of Participating Merchants required under cl.7(b)`


§§ `The points on one purchase`

-- The Bonus Points at a per-S$1 rate, limited by the room under the monthly cap.
GIVEN perDollar IS A NUMBER
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu Bonus Points at` perDollar `on` p `in the month` m MEANS
    min (perDollar TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`)) (`at least nothing` (`yuu Bonus Points cap per calendar month` MINUS (m's `bonus yuu Points earned`)))

-- Additive reading of cl.7(a) + cl.7(b), when the minimum is met.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (a) and (b) add on` p MEANS
    (`the yuu cl.7(a) Bonus Points per S$1 on` p) PLUS `yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(b)`

-- Replacement reading: (b) displaces (a), when the minimum is met.
GIVEN p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (b) replaces (a) on` p MEANS
    `yuu Bonus Points per S$1 under cl.7(b)`

-- The total yuu Points on a purchase at a stated Bonus rate per S$1.
GIVEN bonusPerDollar IS A NUMBER
      c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu Points at a Bonus rate of` bonusPerDollar `on` c p `in the month` m MEANS
    IF `the purchase is Eligible Spend` p
    THEN ((`the yuu Base Points per S$1 on` p) TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`))
         PLUS (IF `the purchase can earn yuu Bonus Rewards on` c p AND (`the yuu Base Points per S$1 on` p) AT LEAST 0.5
               THEN `the yuu Bonus Points at` bonusPerDollar `on` p `in the month` m
               ELSE 0)
    ELSE 0

-- The Bonus wanted before the cap, at a rate.
GIVEN bonusPerDollar IS A NUMBER
      c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu Bonus Points wanted at` bonusPerDollar `on` c p MEANS
    IF `the purchase can earn yuu Bonus Rewards on` c p AND `the purchase is Eligible Spend` p
    THEN bonusPerDollar TIMES (p's `amount in SGD`)
    ELSE 0

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`yuu answer from the points under both readings` c p m MEANS
    `an answer for` c `in` `yuu Points` `of` (`the yuu certain points` c p m) `to` (`the yuu best points` c p m) `wanting` (`the yuu Bonus Points wanted at` (`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (a) and (b) add on` p) `on` c p) `at` (JUST `the miles at least per yuu Point`) `excluded` FALSE `drawing on` `yuu bonus` `depending on` (`yuu conditions for` c p m) `per` "DBS yuu T&C cl.6, cl.7, cl.12, Appendix 1"

-- The certain points: the lower of the two readings if the minimum is already
-- met with this purchase; the cl.7(a) tier alone otherwise.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu certain points` c p m MEANS
    IF `the Minimum Spend Requirement is met with` p `in the month` m
    THEN min (`the yuu Points at a Bonus rate of` (`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (a) and (b) add on` p) `on` c p `in the month` m) (`the yuu Points at a Bonus rate of` (`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (b) replaces (a) on` p) `on` c p `in the month` m)
    ELSE `the yuu Points at a Bonus rate of` (`the yuu cl.7(a) Bonus Points per S$1 on` p) `on` c p `in the month` m

-- The best points: the higher of the two readings, as if the minimum is met by month end.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the yuu best points` c p m MEANS
    max (`the yuu Points at a Bonus rate of` (`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (a) and (b) add on` p) `on` c p `in the month` m) (`the yuu Points at a Bonus rate of` (`the yuu Bonus Points per S$1 when (b) replaces (a) on` p) `on` c p `in the month` m)

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH A LIST OF Condition
`yuu conditions for` c p m MEANS
    append (IF `the Minimum Spend Requirement is met with` p `in the month` m THEN EMPTY ELSE (IF `the purchase can earn yuu Bonus Rewards on` c p THEN LIST `yuu: S$800 of Eligible Spend and four Participating Merchants by month end` ELSE EMPTY))
           (IF `the yuu certain points` c p m EQUALS `the yuu best points` c p m THEN EMPTY ELSE LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)

-- The earn of a purchase at a settled code: Eligible Spend and the answer.
GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`yuu answer when the facts are settled` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT (`the purchase is Eligible Spend` p)
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "DBS yuu T&C cl.9"
        IF `Appendix 1 removes a Participating Merchant purchase` p
            THEN `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "DBS yuu T&C Appendix 1 (the item, outlet or description is carved out)"
        OTHERWISE `the answer` (`yuu answer from the points under both readings` c p m) `valued in dollars at` `the S$ value of one yuu Point`

GIVEN c IS A Card
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`yuu earns nothing under the open reading` c MEANS
    `nothing is earned on` c `in` `yuu Points` `per` "DBS yuu T&C Appendix 1 (open reading)"

`a yuu code that is excluded` MEANS 4829
`a yuu code that is not excluded` MEANS 5411

GIVEN c IS A Card
      p IS A Purchase
      m IS A `yuu month`
GIVETH AN `Earn answer`
`DBS yuu earns on` c p m MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the code is unknown for` p
            THEN `bracketed from` (`yuu answer when the facts are settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a yuu code that is excluded`) m) `to` (`yuu answer when the facts are settled` c (`recoded purchase` p `a yuu code that is not excluded`) m) `adding` (LIST `The merchant category code is not known`)
        IF `the purchase is at Singtel Shop or an Exclusive Retailer` p AND NOT (`the purchase is a Singtel bill` (p's merchant) (p's item) (p's `charge kind`))
            THEN `bracketed from` (`yuu earns nothing under the open reading` c) `to` (`yuu answer when the facts are settled` c p m) `adding` (LIST `A reading of the text is open (see the fork register)`)
        OTHERWISE `yuu answer when the facts are settled` c p m


§§ `The clock the yuu pot runs on`

-- cl.7 ("per calendar month") and cl.10 ("based on transaction date").
GIVETH A `Period basis`
`the yuu pot's period` MEANS `Calendar month`

GIVETH A `Date basis`
`the yuu pot's date basis` MEANS `Transaction date`

#ASSERT `the yuu pot's period` EQUALS `Calendar month`
#ASSERT `the yuu pot's date basis` EQUALS `Transaction date`


§§ `Illustrations`

GIVEN eligible IS A NUMBER
      hits IS A LIST OF Merchant
      bonus IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `yuu month`
`a yuu month with` eligible `of Eligible Spend, merchants` hits `and` bonus `bonus yuu Points` MEANS
    `yuu month` WITH
        `Eligible Spend posted`   IS eligible
        `merchants hit`           IS hits
        `bonus yuu Points earned` IS bonus

`a fresh yuu month` MEANS `a yuu month with` 0 `of Eligible Spend, merchants` EMPTY `and` 0 `bonus yuu Points`
`a yuu month at S$790 with three merchants` MEANS `a yuu month with` 790 `of Eligible Spend, merchants` (LIST `Cold Storage`, `Giant`, `Guardian`) `and` 0 `bonus yuu Points`
`a yuu month at S$790 with three merchants and a Cold Storage group` MEANS `a yuu month with` 790 `of Eligible Spend, merchants` (LIST `Cold Storage`, `CS Fresh`, `Jasons Deli`, `Giant`) `and` 0 `bonus yuu Points`
`the yuu Visa` MEANS `DBS yuu Visa`
`the yuu Amex` MEANS `DBS yuu American Express`

`S$10 at Cold Storage` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5411) `Cold Storage`) 10
`S$20 at foodpanda` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5812) `foodpanda`) 20
`S$100 at Giant` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5411) `Giant`) 100
`S$2 SimplyGo fare` MEANS `purchase for` (`purchase of item` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 4111) `SimplyGo`) `A SimplyGo bus or train fare`) 2
`S$100 at an unnamed shop` MEANS `purchase for` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5311) 100
`S$100 at Charge+` MEANS `purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5552) `Charge+`
`S$100 at 7-Eleven on 1 August 2026` MEANS `purchase charged on` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5411) `7-Eleven`) (Date 1 8 2026)
`S$100 at 7-Eleven on 14 August 2026` MEANS `purchase charged on` (`purchase at merchant` (`recoded purchase` `the base purchase` 5411) `7-Eleven`) (Date 14 8 2026)

-- cl.6, cl.7(a): S$10 at Cold Storage on a fresh month. Base 1 x 10 = 10, Bonus 9 x 10 = 90: certain 100.
